.env
.env.*
!.env.example

*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
secrets.*

__pycache__/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

reports/*
!reports/.gitkeep

specs/*
!specs/.gitkeep
This helps prevent accidental commits of secrets and assessment artifacts. Review files before every commit; .gitignore alone does not protect secrets already tracked by Git.

